{"reviewId": "365275233_87HaaYt9k", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "大宗商品牛市，对于康波周期的回升期和繁荣期，这期间生产力飞速提升，能源商品供需失衡，导致价格不断上升；那么目前我们的经济环境不就是大宗商品不断上升吗？但又普遍认为当前是康波周期萧条期，我有点晕了。还是因为现在的形势过于复杂，脱离了周期变化？", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "，价格机制会在康波繁荣到达顶点之前突然变化，即所谓的大宗商品10年牛市，而10年牛市之后又会出现一个价格剧烈波动的熊市，这个熊市一般贯穿于康波的衰退和萧条阶段，主要下跌阶段维持15年", "range": "9396-9487", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "365275233_87HaaYt9k", "userVid": 365275233, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773823881, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 365275233, "name": "鱼非余", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL8KQHSx0SMQiaFp0m62UpOnSb9yPia8O1fP6AZgHqBs6GPOfYyfKyC5Omx6q7ejOSHibSyeSTWTbJwsicuniaOUv30OWqeZ0e0icVmUypEqz6Ab2PA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 365275233, "name": "鱼非余", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL8KQHSx0SMQiaFp0m62UpOnSb9yPia8O1fP6AZgHqBs6GPOfYyfKyC5Omx6q7ejOSHibSyeSTWTbJwsicuniaOUv30OWqeZ0e0icVmUypEqz6Ab2PA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"reviewId": "3652